# ⏱️ 16. GAME TIME VS REAL TIME

Aetheria should distinguish between:

```text
REAL TIME
```

and:

```text
GAME TIME
```

Real time:

```text
Actual player's computer time
```

Game time:

```text
Time inside Aetheria
```

The game should primarily use:

> **GAME TIME**

for world simulation.

Example:

```text
Real Time:
17:30

Game Time:
Day 42 — 08:15
```

These do not need to be identical.

