# 🧱 46. SYSTEM RESPONSIBILITY

The architecture follows this principle:

### Time System

> **"When is it?"**

### Game State System

> **"What happens because it is that time?"**

### ID System

> **"Which entity is affected?"**

### Database System

> **"What is the persistent state?"**

### Game Manager

> **"How do all systems operate together?"**

