# ✨ 47. FINAL TIME SYSTEM PRINCIPLE

Aetheria is not a static world.

Time continues.

```text
Morning
   ↓
Afternoon
   ↓
Evening
   ↓
Night
   ↓
Next Day
   ↓
Next Week
   ↓
Next Month
   ↓
Next Season
   ↓
Next Year
```

Every passage of time can potentially change the world.

```text
TIME
 ↓
GAME STATE
 ↓
NPC
 ↓
CHARACTER
 ↓
FACTION
 ↓
QUEST
 ↓
EVENT
 ↓
WORLD
 ↓
DATABASE
```

> **The Master may stop playing.**
>
> **The world does not have to stop existing.**

The **Time System** therefore becomes one of the fundamental simulation systems of Aetheria, providing the temporal foundation required for the **Game State System** to continuously update and evolve the world.
